                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-content">
                    <span class="step-badge">Step 4</span>
                    <h3 class="step-title">Board Meeting and Resolution</h3>
                    <p class="step-description">The Board meets and approves the chosen corporate action - Repricing, Exchange Program, Top-Up, Acceleration or Cashout. We draft the Board Resolution so it records the why: the underwater analysis, the retention exposure and the memo's conclusion. The Board then calls the EGM on 21-day notice with the Explanatory Statement annexed.</p>
                    <div class="step-highlights">
                        <span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> BR passed</span>
